Stepping into Iris's personal=
 space, she didn't look at the data. "That is a predicted resonance. Go =
recalculate the gravity phase changes."
Iris flinched, pulling the tablet =
tight against her chest. "Yes, ma'am. Of course. Predicted resonance."
[Elena had told his lie for him. She didn't even know she had.]
"I need the tracking data!" Elena demanded, pivoting away.
At the adjacent console, a synthetic stood at attention. The designation =
