"Fusion Control says the thermal limits are safe, Doctor," the synthetic =
stated, its voice flat.
"Fusion Control doesn't understand the optics of my=
 quantum singularity," Blackwell retorted.
A monotone voice echoed from the=
 display grid above. "Satisfactory, Blackwell," a shadowed silhouette =
